1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,380
(Leonard:)That sounds lovely.

2
00:00:01,380 --> 00:00:04,700
(Sheldon:)It is if you
like bridge.

3
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,830
(Sheldon:)Do you like bridge,
Leonard?

4
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:09,720
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I'm just not
dating someone right now.

5
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:13,770
(Leonard:)I don't need to go
to a senior center.

6
00:00:13,770 --> 00:00:17,860
(Sheldon:)Meemaw resisted at first,
but now she loves it.

7
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:21,400
(Leonard:)Fine. If I don't meet someone
soon, you can put me in a home.

8
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:22,730
(Sheldon:)It's not a home.

9
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:24,870
It's a senior center.

10
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:28,250
(Sheldon:)We'd never put
Meemaw in a home!

11
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:31,020
(Leonard:)Hey, guys.

12
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:32,270
(Leonard:)Hey.
Hey.

13
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:36,650
(Sheldon:)All right, I'll bow
to social pressure: Hey!

14
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,650
(Howard(phone rings):)Excuse me. That's my girlfriend,
Bernadette.

15
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:41,320
(Howard(phone rings):)I assigned her
her own ringtone--

16
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,900
"Bernadette,"
by The Four Tops.

17
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:44,620
(Howard(phone rings):)Hello, Bernadette.

18
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:49,510
(Raj:)When I call him, his phone
plays "Brown Eyed Girl."

19
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:51,240
(Raj:)Which, now that

20
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:53,450
(Raj:)I think about it,
is not so good.

21
00:00:53,450 --> 00:00:56,050
(Leonard:)You realize he's just
rubbing our noses in the fact

22
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:57,680
(Leonard:)that he has a girlfriend,
and we don't.

23
00:00:57,680 --> 00:00:59,840
You mean, you don't.

24
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,040
(Leonard:)You have a girlfriend?

